  "summary": "Greenpill Brasil's agroforestry task force in Rio de Janeiro and the Living Center, a community hub for education, agroecology and culture in Tijuca.",
  "description": "In 2024 the agroforestry task force held an event on food sovereignty and biodiversity, and the chapter ran the AgroforestDAO Journey, a training program that introduced agroforesters to quadratic funding, POAPs and decentralized governance. The first phase of the Living Center, foundations and roofing, was completed on November 30, 2024.",
